            "review_text": "Jellebo T\nHanoi, Vietnam21 contributions\n0\nAwesome food, always!\nMay 2019 • Friends\nI've been eating at Issun Boushi 2 at least 2-3 times pr week the last few years, and I love it! Very rarely is something not up to standard. It's more or less the only place in town to get a proper ramen. The niboshi ramen is awesome. Their sushi is great, and their donburi is excellent. I'm still exploring their menu, but so far everything has been very delicious. The staff is very little attentive and are never around when you need them. They generally act as if they are unhappy about something. There's never a friendly smile from any of them, but I can live with that, as long as the food is so enjoyable and prices are fair\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 25, 2019",
