            "review_text": "Mariana H\nTallinn, Estonia6 contributions\n0\ngood japanese food\nFeb 2019 • Couples\nVisited it twice. The first time spent a little more and ordered some sushi plates, were delicious (around 200–350k dong). The second time my husband had okonomiyaki and i had some cheaper sushi rolls. The only thing that was disturbing during our second visit was that they allow smoking indoors, so there were some guys who were smoking and it kind of ruined the taste for us. But you can also sit outside (I don't get why they allow smoking inside then tho..). It's not the cheapest eat in Da Nang, but as our hotel was on the same street, then it was very convenient when we were feeling for some sushi. And I read from the menu that they offer a good lunch special. Place itself is very simple-looking.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 26, 2019",
