            "review_text": "Aaron H\nBellingham, Washington121 contributions\n0\nGreat Japanese food\nNov 2018 • Family\nWe had sushi and sushi rolls, both with Tuna and Salmon. The fish was fresh and delicious, service good and price high but reasonable for what you get. The menu must have been redone since some earlier reviews, as there is very clear english translations of everything. You know exactly what you are ordering. If you are looking for good sushi, sashimi, etc. in Da Nang, go here!\nRead more\nWritten November 19, 2018",
